      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7517287::web::020::3_3_corrosion_behavior_in_3_5_wt_nacl_so"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing Cr, Ni, and Mo produces a thicker and more compositionally uniform passive film.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increasing Cr, Ni, and Mo enhances the self-healing properties of the passive film.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr can occur as Cr2O3 and Cr(OH)3 in a passive film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7517287::web::020::3_3_corrosion_behavior_in_3_5_wt_nacl_so"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Ni can occur as NiO in a passive film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7517287::web::020::3_3_corrosion_behavior_in_3_5_wt_nacl_so"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Mo oxidizes to form robust oxide or hydroxide constituents of the proposed passive film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Cr-, Ni-, and Mo-containing oxides and hydroxides coalesce into a protective film.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC7517287::web::020::3_3_corrosion_behavior_in_3_5_wt_nacl_so"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The passive film repairs itself after disruption.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The passive film reduces ingress of corrosive species and thereby slows deterioration of the steel.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
